  "goodToKnow": "Das Tageslicht is daylight: bei Tageslicht, Tageslichtlampe (daylight lamp, popular in dark German winters). Figuratively, ans Tageslicht kommen means to come to light, and etwas scheut das Tageslicht means it's shady. Germany switches between Winterzeit and Sommerzeit (daylight saving time) each year, though the EU voted in 2019 to end the clock changes, a plan that has stalled. It has no plural."
